{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":1172474,\"title\":\"Bayside Policewoman Story Early Summer Traffic Safety Special\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"In April 1998, Natsumi Shinohara (played by Yuki Uchida), fresh out of the police academy, was assigned to the Traffic Division at the Wangan Police Station. This was the very station where the legendary detective Shunsaku Aomori (played by Yuji Oda) had once worked. Natsumi, who had hoped to serve with honor as a police officer, soon discovered that the Wangan Police Station was nothing more than a bunch of lecherous higher-ups and ordinary officers who went about their duties like any other office workers. To make matters worse, the senior officer assigned to mentor her turned out to be Saeko Kuwano (played by Eriko Watanabe), known as the “Rookie Killer.” Feeling frustrated, Natsumi drowned her sorrows at a bar one night—only to run into a criminal suspect! In search of the meaning of her work as a police officer, Natsumi resolved to prove the truth in her heart through her own actions.The second special episode of the “Great Search Line” TV series.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7VCcjqwy9mnLYtYk3CtcrWjcWCm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qVRleajhZd1GOc3B7ohoQY4XA8g.jpg\",\"rating\":8,\"voteCount\":1,\"year\":1998,\"runtime\":95,\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"TV Movie\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"JP\",\"name\":\"Japan\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Katsuyuki Motohiro\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":88784,\"name\":\"Katsuyuki Motohiro\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pMzKFkgt18iI8sAyRFQ4ZJt3Cfv.jpg\"},{\"id\":101367,\"name\":\"Yuki Uchida\",\"character\":\"Natsumi Shinohara\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/y6de9FCwdsUGvAsNcamicxovins.jpg\"},{\"id\":68705,\"name\":\"Eri Watanabe\",\"character\":\"Saeko Kuwano\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wlPKI7gXcDo3OWJBTaZBkaUCwkC.jpg\"},{\"id\":82542,\"name\":\"Kei Tani\",\"character\":\"Kozo Shinohara\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9hjm6SmvqQJ4IGwBAeqyAWwYe0i.jpg\"},{\"id\":135373,\"name\":\"Yuji Oda\",\"character\":\"Shunsaku Aoshima\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4Xlcdo6MX1mRx4czPUVIyT8CSHX.jpg\"},{\"id\":234645,\"name\":\"Toshiro Yanagiba\",\"character\":\"Shinji Muroi\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mYD0e645s3qXdSBPkfwCFlaFTnu.jpg\"},{\"id\":110058,\"name\":\"Eri Fukatsu\",\"character\":\"Sumire Onda\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/xlSYQwDHZaXRFVh29JfRlu4EedP.jpg\"},{\"id\":120435,\"name\":\"Yusuke Santamaria\",\"character\":\"Masayoshi Mashita\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/lEIR4wJHwT4dONG7yYk5kLsgUGg.jpg\"},{\"id\":128039,\"name\":\"Miki Mizuno\",\"character\":\"Yukino Kashiwagi\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w4xk5BMMnMeCIjTblQZdfI1g5Fi.jpg\"},{\"id\":1229533,\"name\":\"Chosuke Ikariya\",\"character\":\"Heihachiro Waku\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yASjIZtC9JrBHuB2tqpqhmNxLZ3.jpg\"},{\"id\":132839,\"name\":\"Soichiro Kitamura\",\"character\":\"Soichiro Kanda\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6VAzVpL36IQaBSvmCHMe2e1TJgm.jpg\"},{\"id\":544089,\"name\":\"Satoru Saito\",\"character\":\"Harumi Akiyama\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/fQrAEsi9PAovMy7pGmD6YRgJXzE.jpg\"},{\"id\":544088,\"name\":\"Takehiko Ono\",\"character\":\"Kengo Hakamada\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8gcT8znk0l3YVZKvL7eVxYublTl.jpg\"},{\"id\":554404,\"name\":\"Toshio Kakei\",\"character\":\"Kentaro Shinjo\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/z53xvMy1STh4nMppEjGQWmfB5DK.jpg\"},{\"id\":544090,\"name\":\"Kenta Satoi\",\"character\":\"Jiro Uozumi\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/frDNCchC32sVbTqIa2pd7ica3UE.jpg\"},{\"id\":544091,\"name\":\"Kobayashi Susumu\",\"character\":\"Osamu Nakanishi\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nIjdI0sOhIwOKdf3PaSLJbHYFnB.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":61537,\"title\":\"Burn Notice: The Fall of Sam Axe\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wgQuP4qrsjw4kNgR3sYQeaCNllm.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/lpYER5hPpg1NHki8EVmcDeWi1vs.jpg\",\"rating\":6.4,\"year\":2011,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Before Sam Axe teamed up with Michael and Fiona, he was Commander Axe, U.S. Navy SEAL. The Fall of Sam Axe tells the story of how Sam went from respected Naval Commander to the man of mystery we've come to know on Burn Notice. On what will turn out to be Sam's last military mission, he is sent to the jungles of Colombia to investigate claims of a vicious terrorist organization known only as the \\\"Espada Ardiente\\\" (Flaming Sword). His mission: to determine whether U.S. military aid is necessary to deal with the threat. But when he arrives, things are more complicated than he'd imagined. He receives word that the rebels have targeted a small civilian clinic deep in the jungle. Sam must now save the clinic's doctors and patients from certain death. However, nothing is as it seems and the Espada Ardiente may not be the biggest threat Sam Axe faces.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Mystery\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":835865,\"title\":\"Bayside Shakedown the Last TV: Salaryman Cop and the Last Tough Case\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uc5p9xVvVV5ZsNmDXsqtCF6xp8s.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/vlQKCRNsgKjfGjQEz7Cnx7gFG31.jpg\",\"rating\":6,\"year\":2012,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"TV Movie\",\"Crime\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1434356,\"title\":\"Goen Da\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nb5Lt233Z3Jrpo2v0PuMPG1B2Nq.jpg\",\"backdrop\":null,\"rating\":0,\"year\":2016,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Ilias, an aspiring detective, takes up a murder case to impress the victim's sister and win her heart. Will Illias be able to solve the case?\",\"genres\":[\"TV Movie\",\"Romance\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"I-Wia1UIOFg\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"089ffFVz4lA\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"Vt6fuxthZ_s\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}